      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ugh, finding a place in Lumiose is such a pain!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005500670068002C002000660069006E00640069006E00670020006100200070006C00610063006500200069006E0020004C0075006D0069006F0073006500200069007300200073007500630068002000610020007000610069006E002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There are so many amazing options, you know?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500720065002000610072006500200073006F0020006D0061006E007900200061006D0061007A0069006E00670020006F007000740069006F006E0073002C00200079006F00750020006B006E006F0077003F00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I keep scouring the ads because they all look so\ngood. At this rate, I’ll never choose a place to live!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Actually, maybe you could help. This is all I really\nneed...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410063007400750061006C006C0079002C0020006D006100790062006500200079006F007500200063006F0075006C0064002000680065006C0070002E0020005400680069007300200069007300200061006C006C002000490020007200650061006C006C0079000A006E006500650064002E002E002E00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "First off, it’s Lumiose, so you gotta have a view of\nthe tower, right?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo obviously, my dream apartment’s gotta be\nright <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>in front of Prism Tower<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 161
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And what else is this city known for? That’s right,\nthe Saison Canal!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI want to live somewhere <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>along the canal<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> so I can\ngaze out over its graceful flow on the daily.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 181
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then of course there’s my Heliolisk! We’ve gotta\nhave <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>rooftop access <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>for him. He loves sunbathing.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And I want to chill with him up there, so the roof\nshould have <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>tables<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> and <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>umbrellas<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> too...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And you never want to be too far from a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>café<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> or\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Pokémon Center<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>, right? Those are vital.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Am I asking too much? I keep looking at great\nplaces, but none of them tick all my boxes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So how about you find the perfect place for me?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200068006F0077002000610062006F0075007400200079006F0075002000660069006E006400200074006800650020007000650072006600650063007400200070006C00610063006500200066006F00720020006D0065003F00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come on, bud. Find Heliolisk and me the perfect\npad. I know you can do it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My perfect place has gotta be in front of Prism\nTower, along the canal, and have rooftop space<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwith tables and umbrellas!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOh, and I want to be close to a Pokémon Center\nand a café too!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 195
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "An apartment building right beside Prism Tower,\nalong the Saison Canal, and with a rooftop space<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthat has tables and umbrellas... It’s perfect!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My new bestest bud! You say you’ve found the\nperfect place for Heliolisk and me?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now isn’t this something!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0077002000690073006E201900740020007400680069007300200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s in front of Prism Tower!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200069006E002000660072006F006E00740020006F006600200050007200690073006D00200054006F007700650072002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s right beside the Saison Canal!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490074201900730020007200690067006800740020006200650073006900640065002000740068006500200053006100690073006F006E002000430061006E0061006C002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s got tables and umbrellas on a great rooftop!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200067006F00740020007400610062006C0065007300200061006E006400200075006D006200720065006C006C006100730020006F006E0020006100200067007200650061007400200072006F006F00660074006F0070002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And it’s even close to a café and Pokémon Center!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000690074201900730020006500760065006E00200063006C006F0073006500200074006F00200061002000630061006600E900200061006E006400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000430065006E007400650072002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is it! This has got to be it! I’m gonna go talk\nwith the leasing office at once!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Good news, bud! They said they have a vacant\nunit, so I can move in right away!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And look how happy Heliolisk seems! Can’t you\nimagine it living its best life up here?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Li li li!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00690020006C00690020006C006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Though...the rent is out of control. If I take this\nplace, I won’t be able to afford the cost of living!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Li li liiiiii...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00690020006C00690020006C006900690069006900690069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’ve decided!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020004920190076006500200064006500630069006400650064002100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I love Heliolisk too much to compromise on any\naspect of our life together! It’s gotta be this place!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So thanks for finding it! As for the rent money,\nwell...guess I’d better get good at the Z-A Royale!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look how happy Heliolisk looks up here! I’d do\nanything to keep that smile on its face.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5248,
